526 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 387 0 R
/E (The Society/Apartment Management Portal \(Haven Society Management\) is a web-based application designed to simplify and digitize the day-to-day management activities of residential apartments and housing societies. In many apartments, activities such as maintenance billing, payment tracking, complaint handling, visitor entry, notices, and amenity booking are managed manually or through separate registers, spreadsheets, and chat groups. This results in duplicated records, delayed communication, and difficulty in tracking dues and requests.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
527 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 387 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
528 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 387 0 R
/E (The frontend is built with React 19 and Vite, using React Router, Recharts, and Lucide React, with role-based and record-level access rules defined in a central configuration. The data model is a normalized ten-table MySQL database \(society_management\), and all data operations pass through an asynchronous service layer designed for integration with a Node.js/Express REST API. The application was verified with ESLint, a production build, and 23 automated browser test cases. Overall, the project provides an organized, convenient, and centralized solution for managing residential society operations.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
