698 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 395 0 R
/T (For the treasurer, the application turns the monthly collection cycle into a transparent process. Every bill is linked to a flat, every payment is linked to both a bill and a resident, and every transaction carries a method and a transaction ID. Pending and overdue amounts are calculated automatically on the dashboard, which reduces follow-up effort and the chance of disputes.)
/E (For the treasurer, the application turns the monthly collection cycle into a transparent process. Every bill is linked to a flat, every payment is linked to both a bill and a resident, and every transaction carries a method and a transaction ID. Pending and overdue amounts are calculated automatically on the dashboard, which reduces follow-up effort and the chance of disputes.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
699 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 395 0 R
/T (For residents, the portal offers self-service. A resident can see their own dues and payment history, raise a complaint and follow its status, pre-register a visitor, and book an amenity without calling the office. Because records are scoped to their own flat, residents do not see other families' information, which protects privacy.)
/E (For residents, the portal offers self-service. A resident can see their own dues and payment history, raise a complaint and follow its status, pre-register a visitor, and book an amenity without calling the office. Because records are scoped to their own flat, residents do not see other families' information, which protects privacy.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
700 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 395 0 R
/T (For security and service staff, the portal provides simple, focused tools. The security guard sees a visitor dashboard showing who is inside, who is expected, and who has exited. Maintenance staff see the complaint queue and can update progress. Housekeeping staff receive notices without having to be added to resident chat groups.)
/E (For security and service staff, the portal provides simple, focused tools. The security guard sees a visitor dashboard showing who is inside, who is expected, and who has exited. Maintenance staff see the complaint queue and can update progress. Housekeeping staff receive notices without having to be added to resident chat groups.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
701 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
