/P 395 0 R
/T (From an academic and technical perspective, the project is important because it demonstrates how a real-world domain can be modelled as a normalized relational schema and exposed through a modern component-based frontend. It applies concepts from database design, software architecture, user-interface design, access control, and testing in a single coherent system.)
/E (From an academic and technical perspective, the project is important because it demonstrates how a real-world domain can be modelled as a normalized relational schema and exposed through a modern component-based frontend. It applies concepts from database design, software architecture, user-interface design, access control, and testing in a single coherent system.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
