/T (Vite was chosen over older tools such as Create React App because it starts the development server in well under a second and updates modules instantly through hot module replacement. For production, Vite \(version 8, using the Rolldown bundler\) produces optimized, hashed asset files in the dist directory. The current production build contains 2,458 transformed modules and outputs a 686 KB JavaScript bundle \(202 KB gzipped\) and a 26 KB stylesheet \(6 KB gzipped\).)
/E (Vite was chosen over older tools such as Create React App because it starts the development server in well under a second and updates modules instantly through hot module replacement. For production, Vite \(version 8, using the Rolldown bundler\) produces optimized, hashed asset files in the dist directory. The current production build contains 2,458 transformed modules and outputs a 686 KB JavaScript bundle \(202 KB gzipped\) and a 26 KB stylesheet \(6 KB gzipped\).)
/Pg 28 0 R
