/T (The user layer consists of the people who use the portal and the devices they use. Users are divided into three broad groups: management users \(Admin, Committee, Treasurer, Secretary\), residents, and staff \(Security, Housekeeping, Maintenance Staff\). All of them use an ordinary web browser; no installation is required. Because the layout is responsive, the same application serves a treasurer on a laptop, a resident on a phone, and a security guard on a tablet at the gate.)
