/T (Security in deployment. All traffic is served over HTTPS. The API will enable CORS only for the portal's own domain, set security headers with Helmet, use parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection, and apply rate limiting to the login endpoint. Regular automated database backups will protect society records against accidental loss.)
/E (Security in deployment. All traffic is served over HTTPS. The API will enable CORS only for the portal's own domain, set security headers with Helmet, use parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection, and apply rate limiting to the login endpoint. Regular automated database backups will protect society records against accidental loss.)
