1224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 414 0 R
/T (Implemented in pages/Login.jsx and services/auth.js. The login screen has a branded left panel and a sign-in form with a Demo Role selector that fills the matching credentials automatically, an email field, a password field with a show/hide toggle, and an error message area. On submit, signIn looks up the account by case-insensitive email and password, removes the password from the user object, stores the user in localStorage, and navigates to the dashboard.)
/E (Implemented in pages/Login.jsx and services/auth.js. The login screen has a branded left panel and a sign-in form with a Demo Role selector that fills the matching credentials automatically, an email field, a password field with a show/hide toggle, and an error message area. On submit, signIn looks up the account by case-insensitive email and password, removes the password from the user object, stores the user in localStorage, and navigates to the dashboard.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 414 0 R
/T (2. Dashboard module)
/E (2. Dashboard module)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 414 0 R
/T (pages/Dashboard.jsx renders the administrator dashboard: six summary cards \(Total Flats, Occupied Flats, Total Residents, Pending Maintenance in rupees, Open Complaints, Active Visitors\), an occupancy donut chart, a maintenance-status bar chart, a complaint-status chart, a recent-activity feed, and lists of recent visitors and payments. For every other role it delegates to RoleDashboard.jsx, which defines a tailored set of four cards, quick-action buttons, and a list of relevant records for each of the seven remaining roles. For example, the Treasurer sees Total Collection, Pending Dues, Overdue Bills, and Successful Payments, while Security sees Visitors Today, Currently Inside, Expected, and Exited.)
/E (pages/Dashboard.jsx renders the administrator dashboard: six summary cards \(Total Flats, Occupied Flats, Total Residents, Pending Maintenance in rupees, Open Complaints, Active Visitors\), an occupancy donut chart, a maintenance-status bar chart, a complaint-status chart, a recent-activity feed, and lists of recent visitors and payments. For every other role it delegates to RoleDashboard.jsx, which defines a tailored set of four cards, quick-action buttons, and a list of relevant records for each of the seven remaining roles. For example, the Treasurer sees Total Collection, Pending Dues, Overdue Bills, and Successful Payments, while Security sees Visitors Today, Currently Inside, Expected, and Exited.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
