/T (DataTable handles sorting, pagination, and cell rendering. Clicking a column header toggles ascending and descending order; sorting uses localeCompare with the numeric option, so that "Flat 10" sorts after "Flat 9". The table shows six records per page with previous and next controls. Each cell is rendered according to the column type in the configuration: badge renders a coloured StatusBadge; currency formats rupees; date and datetime use Indian date formats; and flat, resident, and amenity replace a foreign-key number with a readable label by looking up the related table.)
