<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 442 0 R
/E (The application provides ten functional modules, an analytics dashboard for administrators, tailored dashboards for seven other roles, and full create, read, update, and delete operations with search, filters, sorting, pagination, and validation. A central permission configuration controls which pages, actions, and records each of the eight roles can access, and record-level scoping ensures that residents see only their own information. All data access passes through a single asynchronous service layer, which currently uses sample data that mirrors the database columns and is designed to be replaced by a REST API with minimal change.)
/Pg 69 0 R
/K [5]
>>
