/Title (From an academic and technical perspective, the project is important because it demonstrates how a real-world domain can be modelled as a normalized relational schema and exposed through a modern component-based frontend. It applies concepts from database design, software architecture, user-interface design, access control, and testing in a single coherent system.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9376 0 R
/Prev 9383 0 R
>>
endobj
