9382 0 obj
<<
/Title (For the treasurer, the application turns the monthly collection cycle into a transparent process. Every bill is linked to a flat, every payment is linked to both a bill and a resident, and every transaction carries a method and a transaction ID. Pending and overdue amounts are calculated automatically on the dashboard, which reduces follow-up effort and the chance of disputes.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9376 0 R
/Prev 9378 0 R
/Next 9388 0 R
>>
endobj
9383 0 obj
<<
/Title (For security and service staff, the portal provides simple, focused tools. The security guard sees a visitor dashboard showing who is inside, who is expected, and who has exited. Maintenance staff see the complaint queue and can update progress. Housekeeping staff receive notices without having to be added to resident chat groups.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9376 0 R
/Prev 9388 0 R
/Next 9379 0 R
>>
endobj
