<<
/Title (The secondary audience includes developers and students who wish to study or extend the system. The configuration-driven design and the clear separation between interface, state, and service layers make the codebase a practical reference for building similar management applications for hostels, office complexes, or gated communities.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 9380 0 R
/Next 9391 0 R
>>
