<<
/Title (For residents, the portal offers self-service. A resident can see their own dues and payment history, raise a complaint and follow its status, pre-register a visitor, and book an amenity without calling the office. Because records are scoped to their own flat, residents do not see other families' information, which protects privacy.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
