9528 0 obj
<<
/Title (The database layer is a MySQL 8 database named society_management with ten normalized tables connected by foreign keys \(see Chapter 5\). The database enforces data integrity independently of the application: primary keys guarantee uniqueness, foreign keys guarantee valid relationships, ENUM columns restrict statuses to valid values, and unique constraints prevent duplicate emails and transaction IDs.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9524 0 R
>>
endobj
