/Title (Version control and continuous integration. Source code is pushed to a GitHub repository. A continuous-integration workflow \(for example GitHub Actions\) can run on every push and pull request with three steps: npm ci to install the exact locked dependency versions, npm run lint to check code quality, and npm run build to confirm that the production bundle compiles. A pull request is merged only when these checks pass.)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9535 0 R
/Prev 9539 0 R
/Next 9554 0 R
>>
endobj
9548 0 obj
<<
/Title (Security in deployment. All traffic is served over HTTPS. The API will enable CORS only for the portal's own domain, set security headers with Helmet, use parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection, and apply rate limiting to the login endpoint. Regular automated database backups will protect society records against accidental loss.)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9535 0 R
/Prev 9555 0 R
/Next 9540 0 R
>>
