/Title (Frontend hosting. The frontend is hosted as static files on a CDN-backed platform. Static hosting is ideal for this application because the server only has to deliver three files; all rendering happens in the user's browser. Vercel and Netlify both offer a free tier that comfortably covers a society portal, automatic HTTPS certificates, global edge caching, and Git-based deployments. Hashed filenames \(for example index-BG1OJBxa.js\) allow the CDN to cache assets for a long time while guaranteeing that users receive the new version after each deployment.)
/Dest [60 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9818 0 R
/Next 9845 0 R
>>
